From 4be5f29ea4d28fb2977195a041bc1ad931ea2456 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: snap-pea <snap-pea@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 21:15:46 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 18/19] opencl: fixed-width (-DMC_NCOL=2..8) builds of the q8_0
 dp4a verify GEMVs

The mc, mc_lds and split-K kernels reserved accumulators and local reduction memory for 8 columns at every verify width. One build per width sizes them for the actual width and folds the column bound; arithmetic unchanged (identical outputs). Agent bench 45.4 -> 46.4 tok/s, faster on all 8 runs. Opt out: GGML_OPENCL_Q8_MC_FIXED=0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 ggml/src/ggml-opencl/ggml-opencl.cpp          | 34 ++++++++++++++++++-
 .../kernels/gemv_noshuffle_q8_0_f32.cl        | 12 +++++--
 .../kernels/mul_mv_q8_0_f32_flat.cl           | 16 ++++++---
 3 files changed, 54 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/ggml/src/ggml-opencl/ggml-opencl.cpp b/ggml/src/ggml-opencl/ggml-opencl.cpp
index 75313a3bb..9e9016bcb 100644
